    kind: work_item  # 8f5d
    title: "files_analyzed is under-counted by websocket-linker (2 vs 405 read) and carries a ROUTE count in route-handler-linker: one field, two quantities"  # 8f5d
    status: todo_hard  # 8f5d
    priority: 3  # 8f5d
    parent:  # 8f5d
    tags:  # 8f5d
    - analysis_quality  # 8f5d
